{"3887750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Splash Zone", "steam_appid": 3887750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Splash Zone</strong> is a first-person shooter, but instead of blood and bullets, it’s all about ducks with water guns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll run around different arenas, blasting other players with water while trying out all kinds of game modes — like capture the flag, free-for-all, and even hide and seek. Whether you’re playing with friends or jumping into a quick match, it’s just meant to be fun, fast, and a little bit chaotic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No blood. No serious competition. Just ducks, water, and a whole lot of splashing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Splash Zone</strong> is a first-person shooter, but instead of blood and bullets, it’s all about ducks with water guns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll run around different arenas, blasting other players with water while trying out all kinds of game modes — like capture the flag, free-for-all, and even hide and seek. Whether you’re playing with friends or jumping into a quick match, it’s just meant to be fun, fast, and a little bit chaotic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No blood. No serious competition. Just ducks, water, and a whole lot of splashing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Imagine an FPS game but without all the blood and bullets. Splash Zone is exactly that, a fun first-person shooter where playful ducks battle it out with water guns! Soak your opponents in different arenas across a variety of game modes, from capture the flag to hide and seek.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887750/36bcbaad35915611f0e4bbaf0e67fd997a4e7e14/header